Init Scripts
============
These start up ImpServ and TelImp with a "screen" process. Note that they
run the game as root.

On any current Linux system the systemd services are a better choice - they
run the game as the impown user, restart it if it crashes, and shut it down
cleanly. See "Running with systemd" in the INSTALL file.

To use these scripts instead:

1) Copy startimp into /etc/init.d
2) Run /etc/init.d/startimp
